# Same block-interleaved opposite-bias scenario as aliasing_bad, but the
# low 4 bits of the addresses differ (0x103 -> 3, 0x205 -> 5). XOR with
# the address (gshare/lshare) now spreads the two branches into different
# PHT entries, eliminating the destructive aliasing.
